Short:        BGUI vbcc preferences editor
Author:       Tony Jones (nova@nib.u-net.com)
Uploader:     Tony Jones (nova nib u-net com)
Type:         dev/c
Requires:     vbcc 0.5
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

BGUI based vc.config editor for the vbcc C compiler. Can save or load
vc.config files from the current directory or ENV:

Most options available in the compiler are selectable:
	CPU
	FPU
	Math link libraries
	Small code/data
	Optimisations
	startup.o/minstart.o
	amigados/ixemul.library
	Use vcpp/dcpp
	Choice of compilers/assemblers
	.. and more :)
